      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "by the candidates opposing Senator Feingold, by the Wisconsin Republican Party, and by appellant's own PAC."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1581",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "f4f3ef01bb595392a58ff27afef859122337f9db341c9ae515ed6bab630072dd",
      "evidence_id": "ev-f4f3ef01bb59-0002-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 46,
        "start": 46
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE GINSBURG: May I ask you one other thing about the setting? When you went to the Web site to get further information, what was conveyed about Senator Feingold when you went to get that further information?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1581",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "f4f3ef01bb595392a58ff27afef859122337f9db341c9ae515ed6bab630072dd",
      "evidence_id": "ev-f4f3ef01bb59-0003-0000",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 55,
        "start": 55
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "That has been based on objective criteria as the Court has explained."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Wisconsin Right to Life",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1581",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "f4f3ef01bb595392a58ff27afef859122337f9db341c9ae515ed6bab630072dd",
      "evidence_id": "ev-f4f3ef01bb59-0003-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 56,
        "start": 56
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Wisconsin Right to Life, in the face of these restrictions, have still decided that it's more important to lobby than it is to advocate the election or defeat of candidates and give money to candidates."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2005-04-1581",
